the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $x$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 3(5-3x)^{-3}\\,\\text{d}x & =3\\int {u}^{-3}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{3})\\int {u}^{-3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\int {u}^{-3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{(-2)}{u}^{-2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(5-3x)^{-2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2(5-3x)^{2}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{1}{2(5-3x)^{2}}+C] & =\\frac{1}{2}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{1}{(5-3x)^{2}}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[(5-3x)^{-2}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot (-2)(5-3x)^{-3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5-3x)+0 \\\\  & =-(5-3x)^{-3}\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =3(5-3x)^{-3} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{(5-3x)^{3}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["cbbfcc56-2097-59e6-8df3-eab502cf4f79"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "1360a76d-bdc7-5f69-b60a-bd2f09ca9f84" :answer/id #uuid "1360a76d-bdc7-5f69-b60a-bd2f09ca9f84" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{(3-x)^{4}}+C" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "269e93ad-dc56-5ae8-9082-a55eb20287dd" :answer/id #uuid "269e93ad-dc56-5ae8-9082-a55eb20287dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{4}{(3-x)^{4}}+C" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a0336689-0e13-5f83-9272-b3409590e5d2" :answer/id #uuid "a0336689-0e13-5f83-9272-b3409590e5d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{(3-x)^{4}}+C" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "40e2a044-06da-5da0-8f33-77eb00e3d1ec" :answer/id #uuid "40e2a044-06da-5da0-8f33-77eb00e3d1ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{(3-x)^{4}}+C" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5b96278e-eb56-